warner brothers released the first  teaser trailer for the batman  which sees robert pattinson taking up  the role of the caped crusader  while a lot of the plot is still unknown  the trailer gives us a number of hints  about what pattinson's batman will look  like  who he'll be facing off against and of  course  plenty of easter eggs here is everything  you might have missed  [Music]  the first shot of the trailer shows a  man in disguise  duct taping another man's face with the  words no  more lies written across the tape this  man  is likely the riddler played by actor  paul dano  you'll notice he's wearing a mask with  glasses on top of it  fans have pointed out the resemblance to  the infamous zodiac killer  who went on a murder spree in the 1960s  and 70s  this look is quite a departure from the  villain's famous bright green outfits in  past batman films and tv shows  we then hear and see actor jeffrey  wright  from your secret friend who's stepping  into the shoes of  jim gordon who was portrayed by actors  pat  hingle gary oldman and jk simmons in  previous films  gordon picks up an envelope addressed to  the batman  that seems to be from the riddler the  card inside has an  owl on it which could be a reference to  the court of owls  a secret organized crime society made up  of a league of assassins called talents  the left half shows a riddle what does a  liar do  when he's dead at the bottom there's  also a handwritten code  the zodiac killer was also known for  leaving  similar-looking coded messages the  riddle in this card is not deciphered in  the trailer  but game designer mike selinker and  twitter user andrew lane  both think they've cracked it with the  solution  he lies still in another shot  we see the word lies scrawled in red  over a series of newspapers that  repeatedly mention a man named don  zoom in under the headline don's done it  again  and it reads mayor mitchell jr wins  historic third term  so don mitchell jr is mayor of gotham in  the batman  and possibly the corpse as well another  newspaper reads  moroni drug bust in the batman universe  salvatore moroney is an infamous mobster  best known for creating two-face after  splashing acid on his face  while he is not seen in the trailer john  tutturo will play mob boss carmine  falcone  so the mob will somehow play a role here  a background voice says you're becoming  quite a celebrity  that's the voice of actor andy circus  who plays bruce wayne's butler alfred  the line  also suggests that it's still early in  batman's career  director matt reeves revealed during the  dc  fandom event that the film is not an  origin story and bruce is actually on  year two  of his crime fighting career reeves  cited several films from the 1970s as  inspiration  like taxi driver the french connection  and chinatown  taxi driver focuses on a character  crusading against a crime-ridden city  the latter two center on detectives as  well as drug smuggling  and elite corruption which seem to be  the focus of the batman as well  another shot shows a car with doa  or dead on arrival written on the side  driving into a funeral  based on this portrait it might be mayor  mitchell's funeral the man who gets out  of the car  has an envelope addressed to the batman  duct taped to his chest  that looks similar to the one seen  earlier in the trailer  a few classic batman characters are  introduced  in the trailer blank and you might miss  catwoman  portrayed here by zoe kravitz  and the man you see in these shots here  is oswald cobblepot  aka the penguin he doesn't look or  dress much like the penguin played by  danny devito in 1992's batman returns  according to reeves like batman  cobblepot is still early in his career  and not quite the infamous criminal  audiences know  and who is the actor playing the penguin  that is actually colin farrell who is  rendered  unrecognizable thanks to convincing  prosthetic makeup  just like with the penguin you will  notice some differences between this  batman  and previous batman iterations reeves  wanted to give the suit a more handmade  feel  that hadn't quite reached the levels of  ones worn by the likes of michael keaton  and christian bale  and then there's another notable aspect  of batman we see  in the batman that has rarely been seen  before  black makeup under his eyes when he  takes off his cowl  wayne would need to wear under eye  makeup so nobody can spot his real skin  past batman's have done the same but  whenever they have taken  their cowls off the makeup isn't there  during the same moment when batman takes  his helmet off  you can hear a voice say  and bruce wayne replies  as the trailer focuses on gotham's  corruption  could wayne be finding out that he's  closer to the city's criminal underworld  than he thinks  well in the video game batman the  telltale  series wayne's father thomas wayne  actually has ties to falcone  and for one final reference to the  riddler  the character's signature question marks  pop up  when showing the movie's release date  did we miss any details from the batman  trailer  let us know in the comments  i'm vengeance
 

